      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also experience this myself, mainly with the \"Reset Config\" option not wanting to reset the avatar's configuration file. Deleting the file and restarting VRChat seems like the only workaround.\n\nAs I develop some software that relies on receiving data from VRChat over OSC for some its features, I sometimes get reports from users that things aren't working, with it then turning out to be this exact issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
